  id: invoice
  title: 1. First Day, Final Notice
  region: 117° Auto Care / Cinder Flats
  briefing: 'Stallion''s first work order at 117° Auto Care: recover the shop''s stolen
    loaner. Follow it to Half-Price Horizon Salvage, clear the collection crew, recover
    the finance ledger and bring the paperwork home.'
  opening: 'Johnny: Morning, Stallion. Welcome to 117° Auto Care. We fix cars.|Stallion:
    And when the problem isn''t the car?|Johnny: Then you take the shop car and fix
    the situation. Our loaner just left without paying. Bring back the registration.'
  midpoint: 'Johnny: That''s no customer ledger. Sunsprawl is buying cooling plants,
    roads and vehicle debt. A bad alternator we can replace. A business model like
    that needs removing.'
  closing: 'Johnny: First day complete. Customer owes one hundred seventy-three dollars,
    a wheel bearing and one apology.|Stallion: Put it on the invoice.|Johnny: Suzuki
    already filed it under ''unlikely.'''
  optionalObjective: 'Demonstrate the shop warranty: cause 8 pieces of collateral damage'
